    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or sweats; appetite small but steady</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Light pink urine through the catheter; no flank pain, spasm, or leakage</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels open every one to two days; no abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or blood in the sputum</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness on standing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

